# Part in Friendship: "Whenever a nontoken creature you control dies, reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a
# creature card. If its mana value is less than or equal to the number of lands you control, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise,
# put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. This ability triggers only once each turn."
# Turn 2: Bot2's two Lightning Bolts kill both of Bot1's Ornithopters, but it triggers once: Bot1 has one land, the library's top
# is a Lightning Bolt (put on the bottom) and then an Alpine Grizzly (mana value 3 > 1 land): into the hand, and the card
# under it stays. Turn 4, with two lands, a third Bolt kills the Alpine Grizzly: it triggers again (a new turn) and the Grizzly Bears
# (mana value 2 = 2 lands) on top enters the battlefield.

